# Trivy allowlist.
#
# One CVE id per line, each with a comment that states why the finding is
# accepted: what the dependency is used for, why it is not reachable from a
# shipped path, and what would let the entry be removed.
#
# `ignore-unfixed: true` in CI already suppresses findings with no released
# fix, so an entry here means "there is a fix and we are deliberately not
# taking it yet" — which needs the reasoning above.
